        "title": "단계 및 파일 요약",
        "html": "\u003cdiv class=\"mockup-component--detail-step-summary\">\n\u003csection class=\"review-summary\">\n  \u003ch1 class=\"review-title\" id=\"detail-title\">데이터 검토: 2단계\u003c/h1>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"review-stepper\" id=\"detail-stage-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"데이터 검토 단계\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"review-step\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-viewer-page=\"rist-review-preparation\">1단계: 사전 준비\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton class=\"review-step active\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-viewer-page=\"rist-review-detail-55\">2단계: 상세 검토\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"review-file\" id=\"detail-file-summary\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"review-file-info\">\u003cp class=\"review-filename\">SIFT-MS offline.csv\u003c/p>\u003cspan class=\"review-file-type\">유형 CSV-001\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"review-file-actions\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"review-icon-button\" id=\"detail-work-save\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"작업 저장\" title=\"작업 저장\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M5 3h12l4 4v14H3V3h2Z M7 3v6h10V3 M7 21v-8h10v8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"review-icon-button\" id=\"detail-undo\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"되돌리기\" title=\"되돌리기\">\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003cpath d=\"M8 4 3 9l5 5 M3 9h11a7 7 0 0 1 0 14\" transform=\"translate(0 -2)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\u003c/svg>\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\u003c/section>\n\u003c/div>",
